    "description": "Table resize to 0 then back to 4096, followed by simple indexed header — must succeed",
    "input": {
      "wire_hex": "203fe11f82",
      "description": "Dynamic table size update to 0, then to 4096 (within protocol limit), then indexed header :method GET (index 2)"
